---
// Side-by-side comparison of three ways to handle a white-edged product photo on a light card:
// 1. No boundary (background bleed — edges vanish into the page)
// 2. Solid opaque border (harsh frame that clashes with photo tones)
// 3. Subtle semi-transparent inner ring (inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)) — clean edge without clash.
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="img-bb">
  <div class="img-bb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three white cards displaying the same light-background photo: first with no border where the photo edge vanishes into the card, second with a thick dark border that looks heavy, and third with a 1px semi-transparent inner ring that cleanly defines the edge.">
      {/* Panel 1: Background bleed */}
      <g transform="translate(20, 16)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="272" height="254" rx="10" class="img-bb-surface" />
        <text x="16" y="28" class="img-bb-title is-bad">
          <tspan data-lang-en>1. No edge guard (bleed)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Không xử lý viền (hòa nền)</tspan>
        </text>

        {/* Simulated white-bg photo: exact same fill as card so edges vanish */}
        <g transform="translate(36, 48)">
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="200" height="120" rx="6" fill="var(--bg)" />
          {/* Subject inside photo: minimal camera/product silhouette */}
          <rect x="64" y="42" width="72" height="46" rx="6" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.82" />
          <circle cx="100" cy="65" r="14" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2" />
          <rect x="78" y="34" width="26" height="10" rx="2" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.82" />
          {/* Subtle callout arrow pointing to invisible corner */}
          <path d="M 12 108 L 4 116" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="1.3" />
          <circle cx="2" cy="118" r="2.5" fill="var(--red)" />
        </g>

        <text x="16" y="198" class="img-bb-desc">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Edges melt into the card surface.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Mép ảnh tan biến vào nền thẻ.</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="218" class="img-bb-sub">
          <tspan data-lang-en>The subject floats with no frame.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Chủ thể trôi lơ lửng không khung.</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      {/* Panel 2: Heavy solid border */}
      <g transform="translate(314, 16)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="272" height="254" rx="10" class="img-bb-surface" />
        <text x="16" y="28" class="img-bb-title">
          <tspan data-lang-en>2. Solid opaque border</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Viền đặc đậm màu</tspan>
        </text>

        <g transform="translate(36, 48)">
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="200" height="120" rx="6" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2.5" />
          <rect x="64" y="42" width="72" height="46" rx="6" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.82" />
          <circle cx="100" cy="65" r="14" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2" />
          <rect x="78" y="34" width="26" height="10" rx="2" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.82" />
        </g>

        <text x="16" y="198" class="img-bb-desc">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Defines the box, but feels heavy.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Thấy rõ khung nhưng thô và cứng.</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="218" class="img-bb-sub">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Clashes when a darker photo loads.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Sẽ bị chỏi màu khi đổi sang ảnh tối.</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      {/* Panel 3: Subtle semi-transparent inner ring */}
      <g transform="translate(608, 16)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="272" height="254" rx="10" class="img-bb-surface" />
        <text x="16" y="28" class="img-bb-title">
          <tspan data-lang-en>3. Subtle inset ring (10% alpha)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Viền chìm mờ (10% trong suốt)</tspan>
        </text>

        <g transform="translate(36, 48)">
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="200" height="120" rx="6" fill="var(--bg)" />
          <rect x="64" y="42" width="72" height="46" rx="6" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.82" />
          <circle cx="100" cy="65" r="14" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2" />
          <rect x="78" y="34" width="26" height="10" rx="2" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.82" />
          {/* 1px semi-transparent inset border */}
          <rect x="0.5" y="0.5" width="199" height="119" rx="5.5" fill="none" stroke="var(--text)" stroke-opacity="0.16" stroke-width="1" />
        </g>

        <text x="16" y="198" class="img-bb-desc">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Crisp boundary on light photos.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Giữ nét sắc sảo trên ảnh nền sáng.</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="218" class="img-bb-sub">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Disappears gently over dark ones.</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Tự dịu xuống khi gặp ảnh nền tối.</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A 1 px semi-transparent inner ring stops white-background photos from melting into a light card without adding a loud border to darker images.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một đường viền chìm 1 px bán trong suốt giúp ảnh nền trắng không hòa lẫn vào thẻ sáng, mà vẫn êm mắt trên những ảnh tối màu.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .img-bb { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .img-bb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .img-bb svg { min-width: 640px; width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; font-family: inherit; }
  .img-bb-surface { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .img-bb-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .img-bb-title.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .img-bb-desc { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .img-bb-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .img-bb figcaption { margin-top: 0.75em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
